            'text' => 'Deep dive into Distributed Data Parallel (DDP - `torch.nn.parallel.DistributedDataParallel`) versus DataParallel (DP). Why does DDP run multi-process without GIL contention, and how does Ring-AllReduce synchronize gradients?',
