            'note' => 'Docker images are stacks of read-only layers with a thin writable container layer on top via Overlay2. Order Dockerfile instructions from least-frequently changed to most-frequently changed to maximize build cache. Multi-stage builds compile artifacts in build container and copy only binary to final lean runtime container.',
